      """
      Clips the boxes to the image boundaries.

      Input-Output Arguments
      :param self: RotatedBoxes. An instance of the RotatedBoxes class, which contains the boxes' data in a tensor.
      :param image_shape: Tuple[int, int]. The shape of the image.
